<html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><style>body{font-family:Calibri;margin:2cm}h1{color:#17365d}h2{color:#28527a;margin-top:28px}img{width:17cm;max-width:100%;border:1px solid #cad3dc}.break{page-break-before:always}</style></head><body><h1>AutoLoc - Couche Presentation</h1><p>Captures du code des Controllers REST.</p><h2>AgenceController</h2><img src='data:image/png;base64,' /><h2>ClientController</h2><img src='data:image/png;base64,' /><h2>ContratController</h2><img src='data:image/png;base64,' /><h2>EmployeController</h2><img src='data:image/png;base64,' /><h2>EquipementController</h2><img src='data:image/png;base64,' /><h2>MaintenanceController</h2><img src='data:image/png;base64,' /><h2>PaiementController</h2><img src='data:image/png;base64,' /><h2>ReservationController</h2><img src='data:image/png;base64,' /><h2>VehiculeController</h2><img src='data:image/png;base64,' /><div class='break'></div><h1>Tests CRUD avec Postman</h1><p><b>Etat :</b> les captures Postman ne sont pas disponibles car MySQL refuse la connexion sur localhost:3306. Il faut demarrer MySQL, puis lancer l'application sur le port 8086 pour executer POST, GET, PUT et DELETE.</p></body></html>